OL,3,GNEWSABus operator says 69 stops
OL,4,Aaffected by roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus company says it has been
OL,7,Fexperiencing a "challenging month"
OL,8,Fbecause nearly 70 of the bus stops it
OL,9,Fuses have been affected by roadworks.
OL,11,FSanders Coaches, which is based in Holt
OL,12,Fand operates in north Norfolk and
OL,13,FNorwich, said there had been an
OL,14,F"unusually high" amount of work taking
OL,15,Fplace within a short space of time.
OL,17,FThe company's Kieran Smith said: "Since
OL,18,Fthe start of October, we've had
OL,19,Fprobably the most roadworks we have had
OL,20,Fin a six-week window at any one point."
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
