OL,3,GNEWSABus operator says 69 stops
OL,4,Aaffected by roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk County Council said that while
OL,7,Fnot all roadworks were under its
OL,8,Fcontrol, it was conscious of scheduling
OL,9,Fwork around the busy summer tourist
OL,10,Fseason and the Christmas period.
